   "id": "vietnam-tariff-selloff",
   "group": "Vietnam",
   "headline": "Vietnamese shares have their worst day in four months on a proposed US tariff",
   "when": "Thu 26 Nov · close, Ho Chi Minh City",
   "what": "The VN-Index fell nearly 58 points, or 3.4%, to 1,629.68. On Wednesday the US Trade Representative proposed extra tariffs of up to 35% on Vietnamese goods. It has not taken effect. Vingroup fell 6.3%. Vietnam’s trade ministry says it has offered its highest-ever commitments, and the rate could drop to 20% with a reciprocal trade agreement.",
